@ipoolBackend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@token = REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN

### Scalar UI: http://localhost:5000/scalar/v1

### Health
GET {{ipoolBackend_HostAddress}}/api/health

### Health DB
GET {{ipoolBackend_HostAddress}}/api/health/db

### Info
GET {{ipoolBackend_HostAddress}}/api/info

### Register
POST {{ipoolBackend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "Usuario Teste",
	"email": "teste@ipool.com",
	"password": "123456"
}

### Login
POST {{ipoolBackend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"email": "teste@ipool.com",
	"password": "123456"
}

### Me
GET {{ipoolBackend_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

